WEBVTT

1
00:00:44,916 --> 00:00:46,041
Neil!

2
00:00:47,166 --> 00:00:48,291
Neil!

3
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:53,458
Neil Spencer!

4
00:00:53,958 --> 00:00:55,666
Neil Spencer!

5
00:00:57,916 --> 00:00:58,999
Neil!

6
00:00:59,916 --> 00:01:01,583
Ada info soal orang tuanya?

7
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:04,207
<i>Pemeriksaan latar belakang nihil.</i>

8
00:01:04,208 --> 00:01:06,373
Ayahnya kabur, ibunya di rehab,

9
00:01:06,374 --> 00:01:08,374
neneknya yang merawat bocah itu.

10
00:01:09,166 --> 00:01:10,415
Baiklah.

11
00:01:10,416 --> 00:01:13,915
Aku ingin wawancara dengan keluarga
selesai hari ini.

12
00:01:13,916 --> 00:01:15,041
Baik, Detektif.

13
00:01:16,416 --> 00:01:17,374
Neil!

14
00:01:17,999 --> 00:01:18,998
Neil!

15
00:01:18,999 --> 00:01:21,833
Ini bukan lomba. Jangan buru-buru.
Ini anak-anak.

16
00:01:22,624 --> 00:01:25,623
Baiklah, Semuanya. Dengarkan!

17
00:01:25,624 --> 00:01:28,873
Neil Spencer disuruh tidur
pukul 20.00 tadi malam,

18
00:01:28,874 --> 00:01:32,957
neneknya melaporkan dia hilang
pukul 22.29.

19
00:01:32,958 --> 00:01:36,123
Bersiaplah mengabarkan keluarga
kalian takkan pulang.

20
00:01:36,124 --> 00:01:38,624
Detektif! Kami menemukan sesuatu.

21
00:02:08,916 --> 00:02:10,708
Ini bukan Neil Spencer.

22
00:02:36,833 --> 00:02:39,666
Ayah bersemangat.
Ini awal yang baru, bukan?

23
00:02:41,708 --> 00:02:42,790
- Ya?
- Ya.

24
00:02:42,791 --> 00:02:46,748
Ibu selalu ingin kita kembali
ke kota tempat kami dibesarkan.

25
00:02:46,749 --> 00:02:49,957
Pasti seru.
Kau akan bersekolah di sekolah Ibu dulu.

26
00:02:49,958 --> 00:02:51,166
- Ya.
- Ya.

27
00:02:52,166 --> 00:02:54,373
Selain itu, di rumah itu ada ayunan,

28
00:02:54,374 --> 00:02:57,707
mirip dengan ayunan
yang kalian sukai di pantai.

29
00:02:57,708 --> 00:03:01,123
Ayah sudah bilang sampai 1.000 kali.

30
00:03:01,124 --> 00:03:02,707
Tidak. Kau salah.

31
00:03:02,708 --> 00:03:06,874
Ayah baru bilang 936 kali,
jadi pastikan datamu benar.

32
00:03:11,791 --> 00:03:12,999
Aku kangen Ibu.

33
00:03:15,999 --> 00:03:17,083
Ayah juga, Nak.

34
00:03:19,874 --> 00:03:22,999
Angkat! Angkat kakimu. Ayo. Angkat!

35
00:03:24,291 --> 00:03:27,416
Akhirnya… Kita sampai di Garretton.

36
00:03:29,291 --> 00:03:30,249
Kita berhasil.

37
00:03:59,291 --> 00:04:00,416
Itu rumahnya.

38
00:04:01,916 --> 00:04:03,499
- Mau lihat-lihat?
- Ya.

39
00:04:05,708 --> 00:04:07,040
- Hei.
- Apa kabar?

40
00:04:07,041 --> 00:04:10,207
Hei, apa kabar?
Ini mau ditaruh di mana, Pak?

41
00:04:10,208 --> 00:04:13,249
Ya, itu bisa ditaruh di dapur.
Terima kasih.

42
00:04:19,499 --> 00:04:21,082
Hei, Ayah! Lihat ini!

43
00:04:21,083 --> 00:04:22,458
Ayah segera ke sana.

44
00:04:32,166 --> 00:04:34,666
Semoga rumah ini
cukup besar untukmu, Jake.

45
00:04:48,624 --> 00:04:51,790
Ayolah, Nak.
Kita punya rumah baru, tangga baru…

46
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:53,333
Kita bilang mau bagaimana?

47
00:04:55,791 --> 00:04:56,916
Berani.

48
00:04:57,416 --> 00:04:58,541
Betul sekali.

49
00:04:59,166 --> 00:05:01,458
Seperti Ibu saat sakit.

50
00:05:03,624 --> 00:05:04,541
Kemarilah.

51
00:05:06,208 --> 00:05:09,416
Baiklah. Ayo ke atas.

52
00:05:10,041 --> 00:05:11,166
Ya.

53
00:05:15,249 --> 00:05:17,041
Lalu…

54
00:05:18,041 --> 00:05:19,166
cari kamarmu.

55
00:05:49,708 --> 00:05:50,916
Ada apa?

56
00:05:52,333 --> 00:05:54,083
Kenapa kau begitu takut?

57
00:05:57,249 --> 00:05:58,541
Tak apa-apa.

58
00:06:02,666 --> 00:06:05,248
Jangan! Tunggu sebentar.

59
00:06:05,249 --> 00:06:06,457
Jangan menyerang.

60
00:06:06,458 --> 00:06:08,333
Oke, Saturnus bergerak…

61
00:06:10,208 --> 00:06:11,124
ke matahari.

62
00:06:12,208 --> 00:06:13,790
- Tidak.
- Aksi berantai.

63
00:06:13,791 --> 00:06:16,416
Tidak!

64
00:06:19,708 --> 00:06:21,165
Baiklah…

65
00:06:21,166 --> 00:06:22,832
- Oke. Kau siap?
- Ya.

66
00:06:22,833 --> 00:06:24,833
Siap? Ini akan menyenangkan. Oke?

67
00:06:26,124 --> 00:06:29,249
Kau cukup hangat? Ya? Mau bawa ini?

68
00:06:29,999 --> 00:06:30,833
Kau yakin?

69
00:06:31,791 --> 00:06:32,998
Ya?

70
00:06:32,999 --> 00:06:34,123
Oke. Baiklah.

71
00:06:34,124 --> 00:06:35,166
Kemari.

72
00:06:36,208 --> 00:06:38,373
Baiklah. Bersenang-senanglah, ya?

73
00:06:38,374 --> 00:06:41,207
Ayah menunggu di sini
saat sekolah usai, ya?

74
00:06:41,208 --> 00:06:42,833
Oke?

75
00:06:52,958 --> 00:06:58,708
APA KAU MELIHATKU?
NEIL SPENCER HILANG 06/04/2026

