MENGAPA MEREKA BISA TIDAK TAHU?

85
00:09:35,166 --> 00:09:36,041
BUKTI

86
00:09:46,124 --> 00:09:48,583
TIFFANY
I THINK WE'RE ALONE NOW

87
00:09:49,958 --> 00:09:51,873
STEPHEN EAGLE

88
00:09:51,874 --> 00:09:53,957
CHRISTOPHER KEVATT

89
00:09:53,958 --> 00:09:54,873
TONY SMITH

90
00:09:54,874 --> 00:09:56,666
<i>Ikan jenis apa itu?</i>

91
00:09:57,166 --> 00:09:58,332
<i>Aku tak tahu.</i>

92
00:09:58,333 --> 00:10:00,332
KAU SEDIH
WHISPER MAN AKAN DATANG

93
00:10:00,333 --> 00:10:03,040
<i>Ada yang warna merah muda
dan warna biru.</i>

94
00:10:03,041 --> 00:10:04,958
<i>Apa ikanmu akan merindukanmu?</i>

95
00:10:05,874 --> 00:10:07,373
<i>Ikanku?</i>

96
00:10:07,374 --> 00:10:11,123
<i>Kau memberinya makan, bukan?
Seperti ayahmu memberimu makan.</i>

97
00:10:11,124 --> 00:10:14,291
<i>Apa ikanmu akan rindu diberi makan olehmu?</i>

98
00:10:15,458 --> 00:10:16,748
<i>Entahlah.</i>

99
00:10:16,749 --> 00:10:18,291
<i>Bicaralah, Nak.</i>

100
00:10:18,874 --> 00:10:21,124
<i>Jika ikanmu lapar dan kau tak ada?</i>

101
00:10:21,624 --> 00:10:23,541
<i>Apa ikanmu akan saling makan?</i>

102
00:10:24,333 --> 00:10:28,208
<i>Saat ikan lain keluar lewat kotorannya,
apa ia memikirkanmu?</i>

103
00:10:37,541 --> 00:10:38,583
Bagus.

104
00:10:39,999 --> 00:10:42,416
Bagus. Kurasa mereka akan suka ini.

105
00:10:47,124 --> 00:10:48,541
Itu untuk nanti.

106
00:10:53,749 --> 00:10:55,791
FRANCIS CARTER

107
00:10:58,083 --> 00:11:00,290
ORANG YANG MENANGKAP
'WHISPER MAN'

108
00:11:00,291 --> 00:11:03,458
Detektif Pete Willis
terus mencari anak yang hilang

109
00:11:29,874 --> 00:11:31,249
Tn. Willis.

110
00:11:31,749 --> 00:11:35,583
Detektif Amanda Beck,
Kepolisian Garretton. Boleh aku masuk?

111
00:11:36,749 --> 00:11:38,499
Maaf ganggu makan malammu.

112
00:11:39,124 --> 00:11:42,373
Seorang anak hilang di Hillcrest
beberapa hari lalu.

113
00:11:42,374 --> 00:11:43,707
Neil Spencer.

114
00:11:43,708 --> 00:11:46,249
Kami sudah periksa lokasi,
keluarga, teman.

115
00:11:46,874 --> 00:11:50,624
Kami menemukan sesuatu.
Entah apa itu petunjuk atau pengalihan.

116
00:11:54,666 --> 00:11:58,541
Ada mayat lagi. Anak laki-laki.
Sudah di hutan sekitar sebulan.

117
00:12:04,749 --> 00:12:06,873
Tidak semua anak yang hilang

118
00:12:06,874 --> 00:12:08,873
terkait Frank Carter, Detektif.

119
00:12:08,874 --> 00:12:10,832
Tapi itu ciri khasnya, bukan?

120
00:12:10,833 --> 00:12:13,374
Frank Carter dibui seumur hidup di Rahway.

121
00:12:14,291 --> 00:12:15,416
Aku tak tanya itu.

122
00:12:17,124 --> 00:12:20,998
Aku tahu kau harus menemukannya,
tapi aku tak yakin bisa bantu.

123
00:12:20,999 --> 00:12:23,123
Anak yang hilang, Neil Spencer,

124
00:12:23,124 --> 00:12:26,916
bilang kepada neneknya
dia dengar suara aneh di luar jendelanya…

125
00:12:27,749 --> 00:12:29,041
berbisik kepadanya.

126
00:12:31,708 --> 00:12:34,457
Imajinasi anak-anak itu tinggi.
Bukan berarti…

127
00:12:34,458 --> 00:12:37,123
Ya, itulah yang Carter incar.
Begitu katamu.

128
00:12:37,124 --> 00:12:39,248
Benar, tapi aku tak bertugas lagi.

129
00:12:39,249 --> 00:12:42,040
Sudah lama.
Aku pensiun setidaknya 25 tahun.

130
00:12:42,041 --> 00:12:44,457
Aku hanya… Hanya ada satu Frank Carter.

131
00:12:44,458 --> 00:12:48,415
Menurut berkas kasusmu,
ada komplotan Carter yang tak terungkap.

132
00:12:48,416 --> 00:12:51,457
Benar. Itu teori,
dan penyelidikannya terhenti.

133
00:12:51,458 --> 00:12:52,499
Sering begitu.

134
00:12:59,874 --> 00:13:03,040
Frank Carter masih menolak diwawancarai.

135
00:13:03,041 --> 00:13:05,582
Hanya kau yang pernah dia ajak bicara

136
00:13:05,583 --> 00:13:08,541
sejak dia dipenjara.

137
00:13:09,666 --> 00:13:11,540
Ada tip untuk mewawancarainya?

138
00:13:11,541 --> 00:13:13,249
Ya, saranku jangan.

139
00:13:16,124 --> 00:13:18,083
Semoga kau menemukan anak itu.

140
00:13:18,583 --> 00:13:21,458
Dengan segala hormat, Pak,
harapan tak membantu.

141
00:13:34,083 --> 00:13:37,666
GARRETTON

142
00:13:57,749 --> 00:14:00,790
Boleh kumasukkan
ke Tas Barang-Barang Spesialku?

143
00:14:00,791 --> 00:14:02,124
Coba Ayah lihat.

144
00:14:07,708 --> 00:14:08,541
Tentu.

145
00:14:15,416 --> 00:14:16,624
Apa itu?

146
00:14:17,291 --> 00:14:19,957
Kami membuat cap tangan
di dinding sekolah.

147
00:14:19,958 --> 00:14:21,998
Oh, ya? Tapak tangan, ya?

148
00:14:21,999 --> 00:14:23,207
- Ya.
- Keren.

149
00:14:23,208 --> 00:14:24,583
Temanku membantuku.

150
00:14:26,374 --> 00:14:28,416
Oh, ya? Kau sudah punya teman?

151
00:14:29,416 --> 00:14:31,124
Gadis bersweter biru itu.

152
00:14:33,333 --> 00:14:36,123
Kau ingat kita pernah bicara soal itu?

153
00:14:36,124 --> 00:14:38,499
Beberapa teman itu imajinasi dan…

154
00:14:42,541 --> 00:14:43,708
Ada apa, Nak?

155
00:14:46,083 --> 00:14:48,123
Ayah yakin dia tak akan bangun?

156
00:14:48,124 --> 00:14:49,083
Ibu?

157
00:14:50,499 --> 00:14:51,624
Yakin.

158
00:14:54,041 --> 00:14:56,374
Ibu sangat menyayangimu

159
00:14:57,541 --> 00:15:01,708
melebihi apa pun,
dan itu tak akan pernah berubah.

160
00:15:02,249 --> 00:15:06,415
Tapi bukan berarti kau tak boleh
membuka diri untuk orang baru,

161
00:15:06,416 --> 00:15:08,708
teman-teman baru.

162
00:15:09,374 --> 00:15:11,916
Aku tak suka anak laki-laki di sekolah.

163
00:15:15,166 --> 00:15:16,083
Kau tahu,

164
00:15:16,999 --> 00:15:18,540
Ayah tak pernah cerita,

165
00:15:18,541 --> 00:15:23,582
tapi saat seusiamu,
Ayah punya teman, sepertimu.

166
00:15:23,583 --> 00:15:24,582
Benar.

167
00:15:24,583 --> 00:15:27,749
Dia datang saat Ayah mau tidur,
dan kami bertualang.

168
00:15:28,416 --> 00:15:30,040
Di akhir, selalu,

169
00:15:30,041 --> 00:15:32,540
dia mencium kening Ayah, di sini.

170
00:15:32,541 --> 00:15:33,583
Lalu…

171
00:15:34,499 --> 00:15:37,874
esok paginya, Ayah bangun
di tempat tidur seperti sihir.

172
00:15:39,083 --> 00:15:40,958
Ayah memanggilnya Tuan Night.

173
00:15:43,416 --> 00:15:46,373
Berimajinasi itu boleh, Jake.

174
00:15:46,374 --> 00:15:48,124
Tapi kau juga harus…

175
00:15:49,041 --> 00:15:51,583
memberi kesempatan
kepada orang sungguhan.

176
00:16:18,041 --> 00:16:19,499
Siapa namamu?

177
00:16:25,916 --> 00:16:27,166
Tak apa.

178
00:16:28,291 --> 00:16:29,999
Mereka harus mendengar ini.

179
00:16:50,666 --> 00:16:52,374
LAYANAN POS AMERIKA SERIKAT

180
00:17:04,458 --> 00:17:06,041
MEJA REDAKSI WRZR

181
00:17:25,749 --> 00:17:26,790
Maaf.

182
00:17:26,791 --> 00:17:29,457
Hei. Maaf. Maaf, aku terlambat.

183
00:17:29,458 --> 00:17:32,416
- Kau ayah Jake?
- Ya. Hai. Apa kabar?

184
00:17:33,208 --> 00:17:34,665
Ada apa, Nak?

185
00:17:34,666 --> 00:17:36,708
Mau beri tahu ayahmu yang terjadi?

186
00:17:37,624 --> 00:17:39,415
Aku dapat lampu kuning.

187
00:17:39,416 --> 00:17:40,790
Kau dapat apa?

188
00:17:40,791 --> 00:17:43,291
Sistem lampu merah untuk perilaku buruk.

189
00:17:43,874 --> 00:17:45,999
Dia berbuat apa? Kau berbuat apa?

190
00:17:46,583 --> 00:17:49,290
Owen coba ambil
Tas Barang-Barang Spesialku.

191
00:17:49,291 --> 00:17:51,748
Dia mencakar seorang anak. Parah.

192
00:17:51,749 --> 00:17:55,040
Baiklah, itu… Kau tak boleh begitu, Jake.

193
00:17:55,041 --> 00:17:57,582
Maaf. Tas itu

194
00:17:57,583 --> 00:18:01,290
berisi barang-barang milik ibunya.

195
00:18:01,291 --> 00:18:02,749
Itu bukan alasan.

196
00:18:03,583 --> 00:18:06,583
Kami ingin dia menulis
surat permintaan maaf.

197
00:18:07,916 --> 00:18:09,832
Bukankah itu berlebihan?

198
00:18:09,833 --> 00:18:12,415
Tak ada toleransi anak melukai anak lain.

199
00:18:12,416 --> 00:18:14,040
Bagaimana jika perundung?

200
00:18:14,041 --> 00:18:16,582
Anak itu sepertinya berengsek.

201
00:18:16,583 --> 00:18:18,040
- Maaf?
- Kau tahu?

202
00:18:18,041 --> 00:18:20,416
Kami takkan menulis surat itu. Ayo, Nak.

203
00:18:21,666 --> 00:18:23,249
Beri aku lampu kuning.

204
00:18:29,791 --> 00:18:30,916
Di mana kasetnya?

205
00:18:35,749 --> 00:18:40,541
<i>Aku tak suka berada di sana, di rumah itu.</i>

206
00:18:41,083 --> 00:18:42,791
<i>Rumah nenekmu.</i>

207
00:18:43,666 --> 00:18:45,708
<i>Apa dia jahat kepadamu?</i>

208
00:18:46,833 --> 00:18:47,873
<i>Tidak.</i>

209
00:18:47,874 --> 00:18:49,291
<i>Terkadang</i>

210
00:18:49,916 --> 00:18:51,416
<i>dia sakit.</i>

211
00:18:52,958 --> 00:18:54,416
<i>Aku takut.</i>

212
00:18:55,083 --> 00:18:56,416
<i>Tak apa.</i>

213
00:18:57,291 --> 00:18:58,999
<i>Mereka harus mendengarnya.</i>

214
00:19:00,833 --> 00:19:03,248
<i>Aku takut dia mati.</i>

215
00:19:03,249 --> 00:19:07,041
<i>Dia akan mati di rumah bersamaku
saat aku tidur.</i>

216
00:19:08,291 --> 00:19:11,249
<i>Jika kau bisa bicara
dengan ibumu sekarang,</i>

217
00:19:12,333 --> 00:19:13,749
<i>kau akan bilang apa?</i>

218
00:19:16,041 --> 00:19:18,041
<i>Kenapa Ibu meninggalkanku di sana?</i>

219
00:19:18,874 --> 00:19:20,624
<i>Kenapa Ibu tak menyayangiku?</i>

220
00:19:22,291 --> 00:19:23,666
<i>Aku menyayangimu.</i>

221
00:20:51,249 --> 00:20:54,207
<i>Jika kau biarkan pintu terbuka</i>

222
00:20:54,208 --> 00:20:56,833
<i>Tak lama, kau akan dengar bisikan</i>

223
00:20:57,541 --> 00:20:59,790
<i>Jika jendelamu tak terkunci</i>

224
00:20:59,791 --> 00:21:02,083
<i>Kau akan dengar dia mengetuk kaca</i>

225
00:21:03,291 --> 00:21:04,333
Jake?

226
00:21:05,708 --> 00:21:06,916
Kau sedang apa?

227
00:21:11,666 --> 00:21:12,583
Jake!

228
00:21:27,708 --> 00:21:29,082
Bicara dengan siapa?

229
00:21:29,083 --> 00:21:30,416
Tak ada siapa pun.

230
00:21:45,374 --> 00:21:46,291
Ayo tidur lagi.

231
00:22:09,333 --> 00:22:10,208
SETELAN RUMAH

232
00:22:46,791 --> 00:22:47,833
Hei!

233
00:22:50,874 --> 00:22:53,248
Hei! Apa yang kau lakukan?

234
00:22:53,249 --> 00:22:55,583
Hei!

235
00:23:01,541 --> 00:23:05,957
Ada laporan tentang penghuni liar
sejak tempat ini kosong.

236
00:23:05,958 --> 00:23:09,624
Anak-anak menyelinap untuk minum
dan melakukan hal lainnya.

237
