Oke.

262
00:25:19,208 --> 00:25:20,583
Bicara dengan siapa?

263
00:25:22,833 --> 00:25:24,416
Gadis bersweter biru?

264
00:25:27,874 --> 00:25:30,373
Dia takut di sini.

265
00:25:30,374 --> 00:25:33,291
Dia takut di sini?
Dia takut di rumah ini? Kenapa?

266
00:25:34,291 --> 00:25:36,333
Takut kepada anak lelaki di sini.

267
00:25:37,499 --> 00:25:38,416
Kau?

268
00:25:40,208 --> 00:25:41,165
Siapa?

269
00:25:41,166 --> 00:25:45,123
Anak lelaki di lantai. Astaga.

270
00:25:45,124 --> 00:25:47,498
Jake, kau harus menghentikan ini.

271
00:25:47,499 --> 00:25:48,583
Menghentikan apa?

272
00:25:49,583 --> 00:25:51,083
Sialan!

273
00:25:52,624 --> 00:25:55,540
Berimajinasi.
Ayah ingin kau tak kekanak-kanakan.

274
00:25:55,541 --> 00:25:57,207
Ayah tak pernah percaya.

275
00:25:57,208 --> 00:25:58,415
Ayah melihatmu.

276
00:25:58,416 --> 00:25:59,998
Ayah melihat semuanya,

277
00:25:59,999 --> 00:26:03,207
dan Ayah tahu
tak ada siapa pun di sini, Jake.

278
00:26:03,208 --> 00:26:05,833
Kau hanya bicara sendiri.

279
00:26:51,291 --> 00:26:52,249
Jake?

280
00:26:56,958 --> 00:26:57,874
Apa…

281
00:27:05,958 --> 00:27:07,041
Jake?

282
00:27:09,958 --> 00:27:12,124
Jake!

283
00:27:13,291 --> 00:27:14,249
Jake!

284
00:27:15,291 --> 00:27:16,249
Jake!

285
00:27:20,583 --> 00:27:21,999
Jake!

286
00:27:25,458 --> 00:27:26,374
Jake!

287
00:27:27,958 --> 00:27:30,041
Jake!

288
00:27:31,124 --> 00:27:32,291
Jake!

289
00:27:33,458 --> 00:27:34,499
Jake!

290
00:27:50,916 --> 00:27:52,916
UNIT OLAH TKP

291
00:27:59,416 --> 00:28:02,458
Aku Detektif Beck.
Ceritakan sedikit tentang Jake.

292
00:28:04,541 --> 00:28:05,499
Baiklah.

293
00:28:07,583 --> 00:28:08,499
Aku tahu.

294
00:28:09,708 --> 00:28:10,999
Ini menakutkan.

295
00:28:13,749 --> 00:28:14,833
Dia pendiam.

296
00:28:15,333 --> 00:28:16,333
Ini berat.

297
00:28:17,458 --> 00:28:20,791
Tapi entah detail mana
yang akan membantu menemukannya.

298
00:28:24,249 --> 00:28:25,208
Baiklah.

299
00:28:28,624 --> 00:28:29,749
Dia…

300
00:28:30,541 --> 00:28:33,208
Dia kolektor…

301
00:28:34,874 --> 00:28:38,165
barang-barang sisa dan pernak-pernik.

302
00:28:38,166 --> 00:28:39,499
Seperti…

303
00:28:40,708 --> 00:28:45,040
potongan tiket, pita, bahkan batu.

304
00:28:45,041 --> 00:28:47,415
Semua itu punya arti baginya.

305
00:28:47,416 --> 00:28:49,749
- Itu bagus.
- Ya, dia anak yang baik.

306
00:28:50,333 --> 00:28:51,416
Teman-temannya?

307
00:28:52,708 --> 00:28:53,707
<i>Semuanya siaga.</i>

308
00:28:53,708 --> 00:28:57,958
Kami baru pindah ke sini
dan sekolah juga baru mulai, jadi…

309
00:28:58,624 --> 00:28:59,583
